# Context-Loading Protocol

> **Why this file exists:** without a set order, every session re-improvises what to read
> — loading too little (misses a rule) or too much (burns context). This is the runtime
> companion to [`AI-CONTRACT.md`](AI-CONTRACT.md) (the rules) and
> [`../REPOSITORY-MAP.md`](../REPOSITORY-MAP.md) (where things live).

**Principle:** load the *minimum* context that lets you act correctly.

## Always, at session start
1. [`/CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md) — rules & anti-goals.
2. [`AI-CONTRACT.md`](AI-CONTRACT.md) — the rule index.
3. [`../REPOSITORY-MAP.md`](../REPOSITORY-MAP.md) — where things live.

