| <<task_type>> | <<what to read>> |

## When to drop context or delegate
- Broad "where/how does X work" → delegate a read-only search agent; keep the conclusion.
- Don't hold whole large files in context — read the part you need.
- Touching a gated area → stop and run [`gated-change`](../workflows/gated-change.md).
